WEBVTT

00:28:54.904 --> 00:29:00.043
as a lighthearted, happy,
sexy, fun romp of a book,

00:29:00.067 --> 00:29:04.266
and here I am with my face
on the ground in pain,

00:29:04.290 --> 00:29:07.587
and from that place,
I've got to write this book.

00:29:07.611 --> 00:29:10.830
And I did all that I could
to prepare myself for it

00:29:10.854 --> 00:29:14.623
in terms of trying to get my health back
and trying to get my stability back

00:29:14.647 --> 00:29:16.113
and trying to get my --

00:29:16.137 --> 00:29:19.394
I kept saying, "I don't have my vitality,
I don't have my vitality.

00:29:19.418 --> 00:29:22.034
How am I going to write
when I don't have my vitality?"

00:29:22.058 --> 00:29:24.528
And I forgot, even I forgot,

00:29:24.552 --> 00:29:28.516
you get your vitality by doing it,
through doing it.

00:29:28.540 --> 00:29:31.423
Within a week of me sitting down
to write this novel,